       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. At that dose there is a serious risk of serotonin syndrome, seizures, QT prolongation, and other toxicity.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **100 mg** by mouth once daily. This is a common maintenance dose.\n- **50 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the usual starting dose for depression and anxiety.\n- **200 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the maximum dose.\n\nIf 1000 mg is intended, for example under an unusual protocol, please confirm that and tell me the rationale. I'll then enter it with a note flagging it for pharmacy review. Otherwise, tell me the correct dose and I'll enter it right away."
